<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">questdebug</ansi> <ansi fg="red">(Admin)</ansi>

Toggle verbose quest engine logging for a specific player.
When enabled, every quest trigger evaluation, condition check,
and action execution for that player is logged at verbose level,
regardless of the global QuestLogLevel config setting.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">questdebug <player></ansi>       Enable verbose quest logging
  <ansi fg="command">questdebug <player> off</ansi>   Disable quest logging

<ansi fg="yellow">When to use:</ansi>

  A player reports a quest is stuck. Enable debug for them,
  have them retry the quest action, then grep the server log
  for [QUEST] to see exactly which triggers evaluated, which
  conditions passed or failed, and what actions fired.

